• Cleaning and removal of wastewater, weeds, silt and sludge; 
• Deepening by earth excavation and placing earth all around area; 
• Stone pitching; Intercepting drain to collect wastewater from all around drains; 
• Inlet screen and over flow structure for rain water/wastewater, surface aerator, natural stabilization etc.
