Works proposed for development are:
• Cleaning and removal of weeds; 
• Removal of silt and sludge by dewatering; 
• Development all-around, construction of pathway matching with stone work already done at approach, bed and side lining repair works, Drinking water and Toilet facility  
• Landscaping, Plantation etc 
• Revival of existing fountains/ provision of surface aerators for stagnant water etc.
